    <sh:datatype rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape"/>
    <sh:description>Public companies listed on a stock exchange and subject to disclosure requirements (either by stock exchange rules or through law or enforceable means), which impose requirements to ensure adequate transparency of beneficial ownership. &lt;u&gt;Additional Information:&lt;/u&gt; In eForms this indicator is used when the nationality of beneficial owner is not provided because the Economic Operator is registered in a regulated market that is subject to disclosure requirements consistent with Union law or subject to equivalent international standards which ensure adequate transparency of ownership information.</sh:description>
  </rdf:Description>
